    "created_at": "2026-08-28T07:11:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-28T07:11:12Z",
    "body": "> * `line-height` is a longhand of `font`, should it be excluded?\n\nI believe so, but would like to hear other opinions.\n\n> * `font-palette` is not a `font` longhand, but should maybe be included? It matches the `font-*` pattern, though seems to only affect color and not metrics, so maybe not needed after all, unless color is considered a metric.\n\nColor is not a metric, and changing palette does not change anything else so the glyph geometry is unaffected. So it should not be included.\n\n> * `font-language-override`, `font-feature-settings`, `font-variation-settings` and `font-optical-sizing` are already ([reset-only](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-5/#reset-only-sub-property)) longhands of `font`, so they are duplicated\n\nPerhaps this is better handled by \"All longhands (including reset-only longhands) of the \" and then removing the duplicates.",
