    "created_at": "2026-09-11T00:43:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-11T00:43:55Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I just didn't realize *how many* properties were reset by 'font', lol. Fixed to make it clear reset-only are included, and dupes removed.\n\n'line-height' needs to be excluded because it has special handling for font-relative units already, yeah.\n\nAnd yes, I explicitly left out font-palette because it just adjusts colors, which don't affect the font-relative units.",
